# Rat Race's Ququroon against Cook-a-roon's (the kinds only show against a rival: Ququroon has no script, so a lone
# event always plays): a level 75 Warrior beside Ququroon with five fish of each kind, Rat Race accepted, its Prog and
# Cook-a-roon's state set by GMs. Triggers: Cook-a-roon available (241, a Progress) with Rat Race Prog 3 (309, a
# Progress): a tie; with Prog 5 (315, an Event) and with Prog 4 (242, an Event): 241 wins; Cook-a-roon accepted (242,
# an Event) with Prog 3: 309 wins; Cook-a-roon completed (244, an Event) with Rat Race at Prog 2 and Prog 0 (Ququroon
# answers from Prog 3 only: 244 alone). Trades of the five fish: Prog 4 with Cook-a-roon accepted (243, a Progress) and
# with it completed (243): a tie with Rat Race's 310.
lists Nashmau/Ququroon/onTrigger Nashmau/Ququroon/onTrade Nashmau/onEventFinish/309 Nashmau/onEventFinish/310 Nashmau/onEventFinish/243 Nashmau/onEventUpdate/243
